- NFSv4/pnfs: Fix a use-after-free bug in open {CVE-2022-50072}
- NFSv4: Don't hold the layoutget locks across multiple RPC calls {CVE-2022-49316}
- mm/khugepaged: fix ->anon_vma race {CVE-2023-52935}
